{"id":"n70798-2-8","stage":2,"title":"자동 · 自动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70798-2-8-1","ko":"예약을 하고 돈을 안 냈어.","zh":"我已经做了预订，但还没付款呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예약을","meaning":"预约，预订","explanation":"예약：预约，预订；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예약","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70599","senseId":"1","lemma":"예약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냈어.","meaning":"交，提，提交","explanation":"내다：交，提，提交；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"17","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a04df23492bdcfa7","term":"예약","zh":"预约，预订","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3","entryId":"70599","definition":"为使用位置、房间、东西等而提前约好；或指那样的约定。","pronunciation":["예ː약"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"交，提，提交","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"交出或献上钱或物品等。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/20836b2cb5ba558d93b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70798-2-8-2","ko":"아마 예약은 자동으로 취소되었겠네.","zh":"估计预订已经自动取消了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예약은","meaning":"预约，预订","explanation":"예약：预约，预订；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예약","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70599","senseId":"1","lemma":"예약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자동으로","meaning":"自动","explanation":"자동：自动；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"자동","audio":"/audio/ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5568c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70798","senseId":"2","lemma":"자동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"취소되었겠네.","meaning":"被取消，被解除","explanation":"취소되다：被取消，被解除；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"취소되다","audio":"/audio/656f057443f5a13cc283.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78909","senseId":"1","lemma":"취소되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"a04df23492bdcfa7","term":"예약","zh":"预约，预订","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3","entryId":"70599","definition":"为使用位置、房间、东西等而提前约好；或指那样的约定。","pronunciation":["예ː약"]},{"id":"ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5","term":"자동","zh":"自动","audio":"/audio/ca7eb2ef0a71d4f5568c.mp3","entryId":"70798","definition":"事情或行为等没有经过一定步骤，立刻实行。","pronunciation":["자동"]},{"id":"656f057443f5a13c","term":"취소되다","zh":"被取消，被解除","audio":"/audio/656f057443f5a13cc283.mp3","entryId":"78909","definition":"已发表、承诺或预定好的事情被撤销掉。","pronunciation":["취ː소되다","취ː소뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/58974826b99984dba6a7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70798","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4153,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我已经做了预订，但还没付款呢。","估计预订已经自动取消了。","您是要卖房子吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我已经做了预订，但还没付款呢。","估计预订已经自动取消了。","您是要卖房子吗？"],"answer":1}]}
